{"unit_id": "tag:07R1:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>正则点集（regular locus）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>中满足下述条件的<MATH_0004>所成的集合（set）：<MATH_0005>是正则局部环（local ring）。<TEXTITOPEN_0002>奇异点集（singular locus）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002><MATH_0006>是其补集（complement）<MATH_0007>，即由满足下述条件的点（points）<MATH_0008>所成的集合（set）：<MATH_0009>不是正则局部环（local ring）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "regular locus", "target_term": "正则点集"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "singular locus", "target_term": "奇异点集"}, {"source_term": "complement", "target_term": "补集"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "设定概形的局部诺特性。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义所针对的对象。"}, {"source_term": "regular locus", "target_term": "正则点集", "context": "由局部环正则的点组成的集合。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指满足正则性条件的点所成的集合。"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "正则点集的条件要求该环正则。"}, {"source_term": "singular locus", "target_term": "奇异点集", "context": "定义为正则点集的补集。"}, {"source_term": "complement", "target_term": "补集", "context": "描述奇异点集与正则点集的关系。"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "指奇异点集定义中的点。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指满足局部环非正则条件的点所成的集合。"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "奇异点集的条件要求该环不正则。"}], "notes": []}
